{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42425","headline":"游溧阳下山寺 · 许坚","name":"游溧阳下山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地枕吴溪与越峰，前朝恩锡灵泉额。\n竹林晴见雁塔高，石室曾栖几禅伯。\n荒碑字没秋苔深，古池香泛荷花白。\n客有经年说别林，落日啼猨情脉脉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}